    {
      "id": "claim_91e318f96cb34e2f8c92fadae7c37cb3",
      "statement": "test_sortinfolder.py is a single pytest file with seven tests spanning two invocation styles: CLI-level tests run [sys.executable, \"sortinfolder.py\", ...] as a subprocess to assert on exit codes, log output, and --help text, while unit-level tests import process_image or sort_images directly to assert on return values and internal state. The file's __main__ block invokes six of the seven test functions sequentially as a standalone smoke runner without pytest and omits test_cli_exit_code_end_to_end.",
