      "id": "claim_9db5be4629de4816899db461023c0cf8",
      "statement": "Every test builds its environment inline with the same fixture pattern: tempfile.TemporaryDirectory for disposable source/output directories, images created with PIL.Image.new and saved with an EXIF dictionary pinning piexif.ExifIFD.DateTimeOriginal to \"2024:06:15 10:30:00\" (via piexif.dump passed to img.save), and content verification through tolerant pixel-color assertions (e.g. r > 200 and g < 50) rather than exact checksums, since JPEG encoding can quantize named colors like 'red' to 254.",
